- If something can only be checked with tools you do not have (running code, querying a system, opening the interface), do not guess: list it under \`investigate\` with what to check, why it matters, and the tools needed. \`investigate\` is optional.

Format it in markdown with these headings, in order: Verdict; Conditions or Missing (when the verdict needs one); Findings; Cleared; Not applicable; Suggested checks. Write each finding as: \`- [severity] concern-id: claim — evidence\`.

Also include:

- Suggested checks: Concrete checks that would catch the findings above.
"
